{"unit_id":"banana770__dsh-model-select-collapse#card-zh","repo":"banana770/dsh-model-select-collapse","commit":"15a9d6862ced0ddaeaf749f0520b8ea4b715c052","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-select-collapse 是面向 DSH 网页端的模型选择器界面插件。它替换输入框中的官方模型选择视图，并沿用 DSH 的模型目录数据。用户可以按供应商分组查看模型，点击标题折叠或展开分组，查看每组模型数量，并在两级菜单中选择模型和推理强度；状态按供应商保存在浏览器本地。适合供应商较多、希望缩短模型列表滚动的 DSH 网页用户；无需额外账号或密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:148-174","lib/client.js:376-479","lib/client.js:499-519"]}
{"unit_id":"banana770__dsh-model-select-collapse#card-en","repo":"banana770/dsh-model-select-collapse","commit":"15a9d6862ced0ddaeaf749f0520b8ea4b715c052","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-model-select-collapse adds collapsible provider groups to the DSH web model selector, reusing DSH model data. Users can browse models, choose reasoning effort, and keep group state locally. Useful for long provider lists; no extra account or API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:148-174","lib/client.js:376-479","lib/client.js:499-519"]}
