{"unit_id":"banana770__dsh-model-select-collapse#feature-provider-collapse","repo":"banana770/dsh-model-select-collapse","commit":"15a9d6862ced0ddaeaf749f0520b8ea4b715c052","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-select-collapse 的功能「按供应商折叠模型」：模型选择菜单为每个供应商显示可点击的分组标题和模型数量；点击标题即可收起或展开该组，折叠状态按供应商 id 保存在浏览器本地。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:114-129","lib/client.js:376-412"]}
{"unit_id":"banana770__dsh-model-select-collapse#feature-remember-state","repo":"banana770/dsh-model-select-collapse","commit":"15a9d6862ced0ddaeaf749f0520b8ea4b715c052","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-select-collapse 的功能「记住分组状态」：插件把折叠映射写入 localStorage；重新打开菜单时读取已有状态，没有记录的供应商默认展开。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:114-129","lib/client.js:159-160"]}
{"unit_id":"banana770__dsh-model-select-collapse#feature-select-model","repo":"banana770/dsh-model-select-collapse","commit":"15a9d6862ced0ddaeaf749f0520b8ea4b715c052","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-select-collapse 的功能「选择模型和推理强度」：在模型选择器的两级菜单中浏览供应商模型，并可进入推理强度面板选择选项；选择通过 DSH 模型目录服务提交。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:162-184","lib/client.js:447-479","lib/client.js:503-519"]}
{"unit_id":"banana770__dsh-model-select-collapse#feature-retry-loading","repo":"banana770/dsh-model-select-collapse","commit":"15a9d6862ced0ddaeaf749f0520b8ea4b715c052","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-select-collapse 的功能「重试加载模型目录」：模型目录加载出现错误时，界面提供重试操作，再次调用目录加载并显示加载状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:186-196","lib/client.js:448-453"]}
{"unit_id":"banana770__dsh-model-select-collapse#caveat-local-storage","repo":"banana770/dsh-model-select-collapse","commit":"15a9d6862ced0ddaeaf749f0520b8ea4b715c052","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-select-collapse 使用浏览器 localStorage 的 dsh.modelSelect.collapsed 键记录供应商 id 与折叠状态；该界面状态留在本地浏览器。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:114-129"]}
